@prefix ldp: <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#> .
@prefix dct: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<> a ldp:Container, ldp:BasicContainer ;
   dct:title "SHACL Shape Catalog" ;
   dct:description "wiki-memory L3 SHACL shapes (D98, supersedes D77): the Thing/Page-rooted NodeShapes (page, thing, concept, person, place, event, organization, howto) plus working, resource, template, and the class-extension contract. Overlays may add further shapes (addressbook, owner-identity). The catalog is the live set, not a fixed count." .
